# IngSpiderballGuardian stun driver, for tools/cov/specs/isbg_force.py (force.sh): real player shots
# (`shoot`), turned into kSM_ResistedDamage by the force spec, drive ApplyStunDamage -> Damaged and
# Stunned (the spec drops the stun health on every 10th hit), StunnedReaction, IM4 while stunned,
# IM0 (no stun damage, the stun timer held), IM1, the charge from Patrol and from Stunned, and the
# stun (25 s) and charge (15 s) timers running out.
@f300 god 1; layer 13; give missile 50
@f1000 send e0014007a Activate
@f1060 obj e0014007a
@f1100 shoot e0014007a
